  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of the middle term in the binomial expansion in powers of $x$ of $(1+\\alpha x)^4$ and of $(1-\\alpha x)^6$ is the same if $\\alpha$ equals",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "HuUYl",
      "text": "\n$-\\frac{5}{3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LgNTq",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{3}{5}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "6cjc2",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{-3}{10}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r4En7",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{10}{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Coefficient of Middle term in $(1+\\alpha \\mathrm{x})^4=\\mathrm{t}_3={ }^4 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\cdot \\alpha^2$\nCoefficient of Middle term in $(1-\\alpha \\mathrm{x})^6=\\mathrm{t}_4={ }^6 \\mathrm{C}_3(-\\alpha)^3$\n$$\n{ }^4 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\alpha^2=-{ }^6 \\mathrm{C}_3 \\cdot \\alpha^3 \\Rightarrow-6=20 \\alpha \\Rightarrow \\alpha=\\frac{-3}{10}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
